N5008 [locale.general]/8, [facet.ctype.special]: libc++ keeps the "C"
classification table in ctype<char>::__tab_ and its ctype_base masks have
their own bit values; the classic ctype<char> model only knew libstdc++'s
_M_table and glibc's encoding, so use_facet returned an unmodelled facet.
